  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "1/(n(n+1)) = 1/n − 1/(n+1). Write out the first few terms of S_N."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "$\\frac{1}{n(n+1)} = \\frac1n - \\frac{1}{n+1}$, so $S_N = 1 - \\frac{1}{N+1}$.",
    "$\\lim_{N\\to\\infty} S_N = 1$."
  ],
